 "_MULTI_VALUE_NOTE": "date_of_service and expected_amount are multi_value: one email routinely covers several dates of service, each with its own billed amount. A single DOS range resolves to its earliest date; separate DOS entries remain separate values. Several values in those two fields is the normal case and is NOT flagged as ambiguous. When a date and an amount appear on the same line the pairing is kept in result.line_items, because which amount belongs to which date is the part an agent cannot reconstruct from two flat lists."
}
